From 933e1774d0f430f683c7e7e6f99ba5fdf796e4da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 01:58:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(app): import_holders refuses an unreadable library;
 pin degenerate outlines

The MCP import_holders tool no longer falls back to the built-in ids when
the component library cannot be read. It refuses the import by name, so a
new id cannot equal a library id without a diagnostic.

The degenerate-input test now pins two holder outlines: a negative radius
and fewer than 3 points. Each is refused by name and nothing is applied.

Refs #4389

